<main>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container-fluid-custom">
    <span class="breadcrumb-mono">Home / Services</span>
    <h1>Export Services Built Around You</h1>
    <p class="lead">From sourcing to delivery coordination, BALAJEE ENTERPRISES supports buyers through every stage of an agricultural and spice export order.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container-fluid-custom">
    <div class="row g-4">

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <span class="service-num">01</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-search"></i></div>
          <h3>Agricultural Product Sourcing</h3>
          <p>We source Indian agricultural and spice products with attention to origin and consistency, working to match what buyers are looking for.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
          <span class="service-num">02</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i></div>
          <h3>Export Support</h3>
          <p>Our team coordinates the export-oriented parts of an order, keeping shipments moving and buyers informed along the way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="160">
          <span class="service-num">03</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-check2-square"></i></div>
          <h3>Product Selection</h3>
          <p>We help buyers identify the products that suit their requirements, drawing on our catalogue of spices and agricultural goods.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <span class="service-num">04</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-stack"></i></div>
          <h3>Bulk Supply</h3>
          <p>We support business and bulk purchasing requirements, discussing quantities and timelines directly with each buyer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
          <span class="service-num">05</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i></div>
          <h3>Buyer Communication</h3>
          <p>Responsive communication keeps requirements clear on both sides, from first enquiry through to order coordination.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="service-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="160">
          <span class="service-num">06</span>
          <div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-globe2"></i></div>
          <h3>International Trade Support</h3>
          <p>We support export enquiries and help coordinate the documentation buyers need to move products across borders.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt story-section">
  <div class="container-fluid-custom">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2">
        <div class="story-media image-3d" style="height:460px;">
          <img src="assets/images/services-visual.jpg" alt="Coordinating spice export shipments"
               onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615485500704-8e990f9900f7?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop';">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1">
        <span class="eyebrow">How We Support Buyers</span>
        <h2>A Service Built Around Requirements</h2>
        <p class="lead" data-aos="fade-up">Every buyer's requirements differ — in product, quantity and timeline. Our services are structured to be flexible around those differences rather than forcing every order into the same process.</p>
        <p data-aos="fade-up">Reach out with your requirements and our team will respond directly, working through product selection, quantities and coordination together.</p>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn-balajee btn-outline-ink magnetic mt-3">
          <span>Discuss Your Requirements</span><span class="btn-arrow"><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-primary cta-section">
  <div class="container-fluid-custom">
    <span class="eyebrow">Let's Talk Trade</span>
    <h2>Bring the Taste of India to Your Market.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Talk to BALAJEE ENTERPRISES about your agricultural and spice sourcing requirements.</p>
    <a href="contact.html" class="btn-balajee btn-outline-cream magnetic">
      <span>Start a Conversation</span><span class="btn-arrow"><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

